OL,3,GNEWSAOwner 'reviewing options' for
OL,4,Aformer asylum hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a Victorian hotel in Hull
OL,7,Fis "reviewing options" for the future
OL,8,Fof the building, after a contract to
OL,9,Fhouse asylum seekers ended.
OL,11,FThe Royal Hotel, Ferensway, was used by
OL,12,Fthe Home Office to house asylum seekers
OL,13,Ffor more than six years and was the
OL,14,Ffocus of a riot in August 2024.
OL,16,FPoliticians including the leader of the
OL,17,Fcity council and MP Dame Diana Johnson
OL,18,Fhave called for the hotel ` which once
OL,19,Fhosted Queen Victoria ` to reopen.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
