OL,3,GNEWSAOwner 'reviewing options' for
OL,4,Aformer asylum hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Britannia Hotels
OL,7,Fsaid: "We remain committed to exploring
OL,8,Fopportunities to re-establish the hotel
OL,9,Fas a respected community asset."
